---
import PencilFigure from '@components/shared/PencilFigure.astro';
---
<section id="coral-healing" class="healing-photos" aria-labelledby="healing-photos-title">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="healing-layout">
      <div class="healing-copy">
        <p class="healing-eyebrow">Keck-supported coral research</p>
        <h2 id="healing-photos-title">Healing is only the beginning</h2>
        <p>Microscope photographs follow the cut tip of <i>Acropora</i> cf. <i>pulchra</i> as tissue covers the wound and the growing tip reforms. This sequence shows a fragment held in ambient water at 28 °C.</p>
        <p class="healing-credit">Time-lapses and photographic sequences created by <strong>Molly Brzezinski</strong>.</p>
      </div>
      <figure class="healing-sequence">
        <div class="healing-labels">28 °C · Ambient water</div>
        <video controls muted loop playsinline data-scroll-video preload="none" width="560" height="420" poster="/images/research/lth-ambient-poster.jpg"
          aria-label="Microscope time-lapse of Acropora wound healing in ambient water at 28 degrees Celsius">
          <source src="/videos/lth-ambient-healing.mp4" type="video/mp4" />
          <a href="/images/research/lth-ambient-healing.gif">View the healing GIF</a>
        </video>
        <figcaption>One representative fragment. Day labels follow the source animation. <a href="/images/research/lth-ambient-healing.gif">View as GIF</a></figcaption>
      </figure>
    </div>
    <PencilFigure src="/images/research/coral-tip-repair-pencil-v2.jpg" alt="A cylindrical Acropora branch with a cut tip, magnified wound, and stages of tissue closure and early tip reorganization">
      <div class="healing-stages"><span>Exposed skeleton</span><span>Tissue closure</span><span>Tip reorganization</span></div>
      <strong>From a cut surface to a new growing tip.</strong> Exposed skeleton, tissue closure, and early tip reorganization. Drawing follows Molly Brzezinski’s microscope photographs of <i>Acropora</i> cf. <i>pulchra</i>. These are representative stages, not treatment averages or a fully regrown branch.
    </PencilFigure>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .healing-photos { padding: 64px 0; background: #fff; color: #253c39; scroll-margin-top: 6rem; }
  .healing-layout { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(0, 1.3fr); gap: 40px; align-items: center; }
  .healing-copy { min-width: 0; }
  .healing-copy h2 { color: #253c39; font-size: 30px; line-height: 1.2; margin: 0 0 20px; }
  .healing-copy p { margin: 0 0 16px; line-height: 1.7; color: #38504b; }
  .healing-eyebrow { font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; }
  .healing-photos a { color: #22625c; text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 3px; }
  .healing-photos a:focus-visible { outline: 3px solid #22625c; outline-offset: 4px; }
  .healing-credit { font-size: 14px; }
  .healing-stages { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 12px; text-align: center; margin-bottom: 20px; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; }
  figure { margin: 0; min-width: 0; }
  video, img { display: block; width: 100%; height: auto; }
  video { background: #111; }
  .healing-labels { margin-bottom: 10px; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; }
  figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.6; color: #485d59; }
  @media (max-width: 767px) {
    .healing-layout { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr); gap: 24px; }
    .healing-copy h2 { font-size: 26px; }
    .healing-photos { padding: 40px 0; }
  }
</style>
